contact_about: `<h3>About This Site</h3><p style="margin-top:8px">In response to repeated requests to make the Rabbi's teachings and thought accessible to the public, his students and those who follow his teachings decided to establish this portal for the public benefit, on a non-profit basis. The site documents the Rabbi's projects, video lessons, articles and halachic rulings, and offers the opportunity to contact the Rabbi to request advice and blessing, and to ask halachic questions.</p><p>May it be God's will that the Divine Presence rest upon our handiwork, and may we merit to glorify and exalt the Torah, "for the earth shall be filled with the knowledge of the Lord, as the waters cover the sea."</p>`,

